  "description": "Home Assistant ingestion health for websocket-ingestion. Backed by the ha_* metrics, which read EventSubscription and AsyncEventProcessor state at scrape time. Staleness is the headline signal: it is an absolute timestamp, so it survives service restarts that reset the counters.",
